semantic_modulo_float.cmm:3:17: semantic error: operator '%' cannot be applied to float and float
  |
3 |     let x = 5.0 % 2.0;
  |                 ^
what went wrong:
  The '%' operator cannot combine values of type float and float.
how to fix:
  Make sure both sides have matching compatible types. C-- never converts
  types automatically.
